\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">サツ・サク</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ふみ</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">冊</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">さつ</span><span class=\"k-wz\">册（计数词，用于书籍）；册；卷</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">勇</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../../n2/kanji/\">N2</a>勇敢；勇气；振奋；英勇</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ユウ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">いさ.む</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">勇気</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">ゆうき</span><span class=\"k-wz\">勇气；勇敢；胆量；胆识</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">勇ましい</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">いさましい</span><span class=\"k-wz\">勇敢；英勇；无畏；振奋；雄壮；激励人心</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">勇敢</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">ゆうかん</span><span class=\"k-wz\">勇敢；英勇；无畏</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">械</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../../n2/kanji/\">N2</a>机器；器械；枷锁；束缚</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">カイ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">かせ</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">機械</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">きかい</span><span class=\"k-wz\">机器；机械装置；仪器；器具；装置</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">器械</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">きかい</span><span class=\"k-wz\">机器；机械装置；仪器；器具；装置</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">菜</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../../n2/kanji/\">N2</a>蔬菜；配菜；青菜</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">サイ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">な</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">野菜</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">やさい</span><span class=\"k-wz\">蔬菜；大麻；大麻制品</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">珍</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../../n2/kanji/\">N2</a>珍奇；罕见；奇怪</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">チン</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">めずら.しい・たから</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">珍しい</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">めずらしい</span><span class=\"k-wz\">罕见的；稀奇的</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">卵</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../../n2/kanji/\">N2</a>蛋；卵子；鱼卵；卵块</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ラン</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">たまご</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">卵</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">たまご</span><span class=\"k-wz\">蛋；卵；鱼卵；蛙卵；鸡蛋；未来的……；……的苗子；初出茅庐的……；开始；起源；初期</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">湖</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../../n2/kanji/\">N2</a>湖</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">コ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">みずうみ</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">湖</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">みずうみ</span><span class=\"k-wz\">湖</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">喫</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../../n2/kanji/\">N2</a>喝；吃；吸（烟）；遭受（打击）</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">キツ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">の.む</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">喫茶店</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">きっさてん</span><span class=\"k-wz\">咖啡店；茶室；咖啡厅；咖啡馆；传统咖啡馆（具有复古氛围）</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">喫茶</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">きっさ</span><span class=\"k-wz\">喝茶；品茶；茶馆；茶室；咖啡店；咖啡厅；咖啡馆</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">干</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../../n2/kanji/\">N2</a>干燥；晒干；干涉；退潮；干涸</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">カン</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ほ.す・ほ.し-・-ぼ.し・ひ.る</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">干す</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">ほす</span><span class=\"k-wz\">晾干；晒干；使干燥；沥干；排干；喝干；饮尽；使失去职位；剥夺工作机会</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">梅干</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">うめぼし</span><span class=\"k-wz\">梅干；腌梅；盐渍梅干</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">干渉</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">かんしょう</span><span class=\"k-wz\">干涉；介入；干预</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">虫</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../../n2/kanji/\">N2</a>虫；脾气；性情</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">チュウ・キ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">むし</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">虫</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">むし</span><span class=\"k-wz\">昆虫；虫子；蟋蟀；蛾；蠕虫；蛔虫；影响思想感情的体内之物；潜意识；紧张；焦躁；专注于一事的人；执着的人；气门芯；（花札）虫（用减去部分牌的花札玩的一种牌戏）</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">虫歯</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">むしば</span><span class=\"k-wz\">蛀牙；龋齿；牙洞；龋病</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">昆虫</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">こんちゅう</span><span class=\"k-wz\">昆虫；虫</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">刷</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../../n2/kanji/\">N2</a>印刷；刷子；刷；拓印</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">サツ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">す.る・-ず.り・-ずり・は.く</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">印刷</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">いんさつ</span><span class=\"k-wz\">印刷</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">刷る</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">する</span><span class=\"k-wz\">印刷；印制；用木模印染布料；印花</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">刷り</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">すり</span><span class=\"k-wz\">印刷</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">湯</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../../n2/kanji/\">N2</a>热水；浴池；温泉</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">トウ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ゆ</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">湯</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">ゆ</span><span class=\"k-wz\">热水；热浴；温泉；熔铁</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">湯気</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">ゆげ</span><span class=\"k-wz\">蒸汽；水蒸气</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">湯飲み</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">ゆのみ</span><span class=\"k-wz\">茶杯；茶盏</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">溶</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../../n2/kanji/\">N2</a>溶解；融化；熔化</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ヨウ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">と.ける・と.かす・と.く</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">溶く</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">とく</span><span class=\"k-wz\">混合；溶解；混入；打散；搅拌；搅匀；熔化；液化；冶炼；解冻；熔合</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">溶岩</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">ようがん</span><span class=\"k-wz\">熔岩</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">溶かす</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">とかす</span><span class=\"k-wz\">熔化；液化；解冻；溶解；使溶于液体；赔钱；挥霍；浪费（金钱）</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">鉱</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../../n2/kanji/\">N2</a>矿物；矿石</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">コウ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">あらがね</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">鉱物</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">こうぶつ</span><span class=\"k-wz\">矿物</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">炭鉱</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">たんこう</span><span class=\"k-wz\">煤矿；煤井；煤窑；煤矿竖井；矿井</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">鉱業</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">こうぎょう</span><span class=\"k-wz\">矿业；采矿业</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">涙</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../../n2/kanji/\">N2</a>眼泪；同情</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ルイ・レイ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">なみだ</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">涙</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">なみだ</span><span class=\"k-wz\">眼泪；泪水；同情；怜悯</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">匹</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../../n2/kanji/\">N2</a>匹（动物计数）；匹（布匹单位）；匹敌；对等</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ヒツ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ひき</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">匹</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">ひき</span><span class=\"k-wz\">小动物的计数词；布匹的计数词（两反为一匹）；马的计数词（古语）；布匹；布卷</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">匹敵</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">ひってき</span><span class=\"k-wz\">匹敌；相当；等同；比得上</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">孫</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../../n2/kanji/\">N2</a>孙子；孙女；后代</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ソン</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">まご</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">孫</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">まご</span><span class=\"k-wz\">孙辈</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">子孫</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">しそん</span><span class=\"k-wz\">后代；子孙；后裔</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">鋭</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../../n2/kanji/\">N2</a>尖锐；锋利；锐利；猛烈；敏锐</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">エイ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">するど.い</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">鋭い</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">するどい</span><span class=\"k-wz\">锋利的；尖锐的；（疼痛、声调等）剧烈的；尖锐的；（批评等）尖锐的；尖酸的；（攻击）猛烈的；（问题、目光等）犀利的；锐利的；（直觉、嗅觉等）敏锐的；灵敏的；（头脑等）敏锐的；机敏的；有洞察力的</span></li></ul></div></li>"]